flowchart LR
    D[Builder submits diff] --> S{Inside blast radius?}
    S -->|no| X[Reject and re-plan the stack]
    S -->|yes| T{Unit tests pass?}
    T -->|no| F[Return to Builder with evidence]
    T -->|yes| A[Merge into node PR branch]

